ze. Her expression stays serene, lips part slightly as she speaks, eyes holding a quiet resolution.\n\n[Camera]\nWide shot tracking the king’s descent, then smooth push-in to extreme close-up on Miao Shan’s face as she speaks. Single continuous take, no cuts.\n\n[Audio]\n0s-4s: Heavy footsteps echoing on stone, cushion hitting the floor with a muffled thud.\n4s-7s: \"修行？你是北阙公主！岂能像那等尼姑般苟活！\" — Miao Zhuang Wang (dialogue, lip-sync active).\n7s: \"众生皆苦，儿臣愿以此身，渡己渡人。\" — Miao Shan (dialogue, lip-sync active).\nLow tense drone throughout.\n\n[Narrative]\nFather confronts daughter over her decision to practice Buddhism. Tension builds as he berates her, then shifts to quiet defiance as she calmly states her purpose. Single continuous take, camera moving from the king’s aggression to the princess’s stillness."],"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":35,"type":"SaveImage","pos":[6984.540119910704,857.6118520365708],"size":[1539.4444580078125,1011.6666870117188],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"images","localized_name":"图片","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":23},{"label":"filename_prefix","localized_name":"文件名前缀","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"}}],"outputs":[{"label":"image_urls","name":"image_urls","type":"STRING"}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"SaveImage","cnr_id":"comfy-core","hasSecondTab":false,"ver":"0.8.2","widget_ue_connectable":{},"secondTabText":"Send Back","enableTabs":false,"secondTabOffset":80,"tabWidth":65,"secondTabWidth":65,"tabXOffset":10},"widgets_values":["Flux2-Klein"]}],"links":[[23,54,0,35,0,"IMAGE"],[24,43,0,36,0,"NOISE"],[25,37,0,36,1,"GUIDER"],[26,42,0,36,2,"SAMPLER"],[27,38,0,36,3,"SIGMAS"],[28,47,0,36,4,"LATENT"],[29,50,0,37,0,"MODEL"],[30,45,0,37,1,"CONDITIONING"],[31,44,0,37,2,"CONDITIONING"],[32,52,0,38,1,"INT"],[33,52,1,38,2,"INT"],[34,56,0,39,0,"CONDITIONING"],[35,39,0,44,0,"CONDITIONING"],[36,46,0,44,1,"LATENT"],[37,56,0,45,0,"CONDITIONING"],[38,46,0,45,1,"L